---
import Layout from '@layouts/Layout.astro';
const title = '互免签证协议（29个国家）——中国入门指南';
const description = 'Complete guide to China\'s mutual visa-free agreements with 29 countries — stay limits, passport requirements, and full country list.';
---

<Layout title={title} description={description} lang="zh">
  <article class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-12">
    <nav class="mb-8 not-prose">
      <a href="/zh/prepare/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm text-gray-400 hover:text-gray-700 transition no-underline group">
        <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5 transition-transform group-hover:-translate-x-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 19l-7-7 7-7"/>
        </svg>
        Back to Prepare
      </a>
    </nav>
    <!-- Header -->
    <header class="mb-12">
      <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mb-3">📋 入境和签证</p>
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-gray-900 mb-4 leading-tight">
        Mutual Visa-Free Agreements (29 Countries)
      </h1>
      <p class="text-xl text-gray-600 mb-6">中国已与29个国家签署了免签证协议，以下是每个国家对您的旅行意味着什么。</p>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4 text-sm text-gray-500">
        <span>📅 最后更新日期：2026年6月</span>
        <span>⏱️ 阅读5分钟</span>
      </div>
    </header>

    <!-- Quick Answer Box -->
    <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-teal-50 to-emerald-50 border-l-4 border-teal-500 rounded-r-2xl p-8 mb-12 not-prose">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-teal-900 mb-4">--填写您的签证申请</h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-teal-800 leading-relaxed">
        <strong>是的，根据双方协议，29个国家的公民可以免签证进入中国。</strong> Unlike China's unilateral visa-free policy (which China offers on its own), these are bilateral deals where both countries agree to waive visa requirements for each other's citizens. Stay limits range from <strong>30至90天</strong> depending on the agreement.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Main Content -->
    <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none">

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6">
        Below are the 29 countries that have signed mutual visa-exemption agreements with China. Source: <a href="http://big5.www.gov.cn/gate/big5/www.gov.cn/yaowen/liebiao/202508/content_7035244.htm" class="text-brand-600 underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener">中国政府网</a>.
      </p>

      <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />

      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="text-4xl">🌍</span> Full List of 29 Countries
      </h2>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-4">
        Citizens holding <strong>普通护照</strong> from these countries can enter China visa-free for short stays:
      </p>

      <div class="bg-teal-50 border border-teal-200 rounded-2xl p-6 mb-8 not-prose">
        <div class="grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-2 text-gray-700">
          <span>🇦🇱 阿尔巴尼亚</span>
          <span>🇦🇪 阿拉伯联合酋长国</span>
          <span>🇦🇬 安提瓜和巴布达</span>
          <span>🇦🇲 亚美尼亚</span>
          <span>🇦🇿 阿塞拜疆</span>
          <span>🇧🇸 巴哈马</span>
          <span>🇧🇧 巴巴多斯</span>
          <span>🇧🇾 白俄罗斯</span>
          <span>🇧🇦 波斯尼亚和黑塞哥维那</span>
          <span>🇩🇲 多米尼加</span>
          <span>🇪🇨 厄瓜多尔</span>
          <span>🇫🇯 斐济</span>
          <span>🇬🇪 格鲁吉亚</span>
          <span>🇬🇩 格林纳达</span>
          <span>🇰🇿 哈萨克斯坦</span>
          <span>🇲🇾 马来西亚</span>
          <span>🇲🇻 马尔代夫</span>
          <span>🇲🇺 毛里求斯</span>
          <span>🇶🇦 卡塔尔</span>
          <span>🇼🇸 萨摩亚</span>
          <span>🇸🇲 圣马力诺</span>
          <span>🇷🇸 塞尔维亚</span>
          <span>🇸🇨 塞舌尔</span>
          <span>🇸🇬 新加坡</span>
          <span>🇸🇧 所罗门群岛</span>
          <span>🇸🇷 苏里南</span>
          <span>🇹🇭 泰国</span>
          <span>🇹🇴 汤加</span>
          <span>🇺🇿 乌兹别克斯坦</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />

      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="text-4xl">⏱️</span> How Long Can You Stay?
      </h2>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-4">
        Stay durations vary by agreement. Most mutual visa-free deals allow <strong>每次入境30天</strong>, but some countries have more generous terms:
      </p>

      <div class="space-y-4 mb-8 not-prose">
        <div class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-5">
          <p class="font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-1">🇸🇬 新加坡-每次入境最多90天</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">在任何180天内，在中国的累计停留时间不得超过90天。这是中国目前最慷慨的互免签证安排。</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-5">
          <p class="font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-1">🇦🇪 阿联酋，🇶🇦 卡塔尔，🇧🇾 白俄罗斯-每次入境最多30天</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">标准30天免签证逗留。在特定条件下可扩展。</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-5">
          <p class="font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-1">🇹🇭 泰国，🇲🇾 马来西亚，其他大多数国家-每次入境最多30天</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">旅游和商务访问的标准30天免签证入境。</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />

      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="text-4xl">🛂</span> Unilateral vs Mutual: What's the Difference?
      </h2>

      <div class="overflow-x-auto mb-8 not-prose">
        <table class="w-full text-left border-collapse bg-white rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-sm">
          <thead>
            <tr class="bg-gray-900 text-white">
              <th class="px-5 py-3 font-bold"></th>
              <th class="px-5 py-3 font-bold text-center bg-green-600">单边（50个国家）</th>
              <th class="px-5 py-3 font-bold text-center bg-teal-600">互助（29个国家）</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100">
              <td class="px-5 py-3 font-semibold">自然</td>
              <td class="px-5 py-3 text-center">中国独自提供</td>
              <td class="px-5 py-3 text-center">双边协议</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100 bg-gray-50">
              <td class="px-5 py-3 font-semibold">最大停留时间</td>
              <td class="px-5 py-3 text-center">我可以延期吗？</td>
              <td class="px-5 py-3 text-center">30-90天（有所不同）</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100">
              <td class="px-5 py-3 font-semibold">互惠？</td>
              <td class="px-5 py-3 text-center">否--仅限中国</td>
              <td class="px-5 py-3 text-center">是的，双向</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>

      <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />

      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="text-4xl">❓</span> Frequently Asked Questions
      </h2>

      <div class="space-y-6 mb-8 not-prose">
        <div class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-6">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2">我可以延长免签证期吗？</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">在大多数情况下，没有。您需要在允许的逗留到期之前离开中国。如果您需要更多时间，最好的选择是退出并重新进入（例如，前往香港或澳门的短途旅行）。</p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-6">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2">90/180规则是否适用于所有共同协议国家？</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">不是。“任何180天内的90天”限制特别适用于新加坡。其他国家有自己的条款——大多数国家允许每次入境30天。始终检查您所在国家的具体协议。</p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-6">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2">我的国家在这两个名单上——哪条规则适用？</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">如果您的国家同时在单边免签证名单（50个国家）和共同协议名单（29个国家）上，则适用更优惠的条款。例如，新加坡在这两个名单上，但双方协议提供了更长的停留时间——所以你会使用双方协议的条款。</p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-6">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2">我在移民局需要什么文件？</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">有效的普通护照（至少6个月有效期）、往返机票和住宿证明。移民局也可能会询问你的旅行计划，所以准备一个粗略的行程会有所帮助。</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Related Guides -->
    <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl p-8 not-prose mt-12">
      <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6">紧急电话号码以及需要帮助时该怎么办</h3>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
        <a href="/zh/visa/visa-guide/" class="block bg-white rounded-xl p-5 hover:shadow-md transition border border-gray-100">
          <p class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1">一些中心接受步行入内，通常在清晨。在当地中心的网站上查看他们的政策。</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">第三步：访问签证中心</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/zh/visa/visa-free/" class="block bg-white rounded-xl p-5 hover:shadow-md transition border border-gray-100">
          <p class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1">中国免签证国家名单</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">单边+相互列表组合</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/zh/visa/transit-240/" class="block bg-white rounded-xl p-5 hover:shadow-md transition border border-gray-100">
          <p class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1">240小时免签证过境说明</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">相互免签证协议（29个国家）</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/zh/visa/apply-l-visa/" class="block bg-white rounded-xl p-5 hover:shadow-md transition border border-gray-100">
          <p class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1">如何申请中国旅游签证（L型）</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">如何在中国付款</p>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>
